# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Production output: exact bytes, never normalised.
#
# The root .gitattributes says the same thing about this directory, but a
# nested attributes file wins over the root for the paths beneath it, so the
# `* text=auto` above was silently overriding it. That LF-normalised the twenty
# frozen production artifacts in the repository while HASHES.json continued to
# record the raw bytes they were frozen from - so the fixture reproduced only
# on a checkout that happened to leave them alone, and failed everywhere else.
#
# These are the release this fixture exists to hold still. Their SHA-256 is
# the fixture.
generated/release/** -text
